<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Mighty Black Cat ($MIGHTY)</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0a2e 0%, #2d1b4e 50%, #0f0518 100%);
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #c77dff;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 8vw, 4.5rem);
            font-weight: 900;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #e0aaff, #c77dff, #9b5de5);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .ticker {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: #c77dff;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        .cat-img {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(155, 93, 229, 0.45);
            border: 3px solid #9b5de5;
            margin: 20px auto 35px;
        }
        .description {
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #e0d4ff;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
        }
        .description strong { color: #c77dff; }
        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 16px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 14px 28px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
        }
        .btn-pump {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #9b5de5, #c77dff);
            color: #1a0a2e;
        }
        .btn-tg {
            background: transparent;
            color: #c77dff;
            border-color: #c77dff;
        }
        .btn-x {
            background: transparent;
            color: #e0aaff;
            border-color: #e0aaff;
        }
        footer {
            margin-top: auto;
            padding: 25px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #9b7bb8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">The strongest black cat in the game</div>
        <h1>Mighty Black Cat</h1>
        <div class="ticker">$MIGHTY</div>

        <img src="5999060171751099716_121.jpg" alt="Mighty Black Cat" class="cat-img">

        <p class="description">
            Born to flex, built to pump, and ready to take over the charts.<br>
            <strong>One mighty meow at a time.</strong>
        </p>

        <div class="buttons">
            <a href="https://pump.fun/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-pump">Buy on Pump.fun</a>
            <a href="https://t.me/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-tg">Telegram</a>
            <a href="https://x.com/" target="_blank" class="btn btn-x">Follow on X</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>$MIGHTY • Built different • 2026</footer>
</body>
</html>
